    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invisible Ascent is a vertical precision platformer game where you have to remember the platforms before they disappear and time your jumps on those invisible platforms.<br><br>You were just a regular person, minding your business, when your internet bill arrived. But this wasn\u2019t just any bill. <strong>It was an ungodly, soul-crushing amount.</strong> Furious, you did what any sane person would do, you <strong>refused to pay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agents came and they dragged you in hell and now your router is on the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
